      "id": "claim_961e090fafbf4e7da78a0e87637c4ea3",
      "statement": "Core::Memory installs the owning KProcess page table and uses DeviceMemory as backing storage. The application can expose the fastmem arena when fastmem is enabled; other cases leave it unset. The Dynarmic integration takes the process page table and configures its own execution-side access paths from that memory state.",
