    {
      "id": "claim_b168911417e8441fac2cb225af90a9ac",
      "statement": "Block accesses walk the process mapping. Reads of unmapped portions fill the destination with zeroes. Rasterizer-tracked pages can trigger a download before a safe read, or a renderer write notification before a safe write. The unsafe variants skip those renderer callbacks, so a mapped address alone does not establish coherency.",
