    {
      "id": "claim_66621d5041bc4383a5c933ce40b4d8cc",
      "statement": "Tegra::MemoryManager maps GPU virtual addresses to device addresses using small or large pages. Sparse reservations have a separate entry type. Despite its name, GpuToCpuAddress returns an optional DAddr, rejects unmapped or out-of-range input and prefers mapped big pages before testing small pages.",
