    {
      "id": "claim_7de90e25418c409f8edcc6a4932228aa",
      "statement": "GPU unmap walks the submapped ranges and notifies the rasterizer before clearing entries from both page tables. This ordering lets the renderer release its tracking while the mapped ranges are still known. Start with the GPU memory manager for address translation and the GPU command page for coherency across queued work.",
